{"id":"e937528586d5f172","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits.md","title":"Theorem — Right Adjoints Preserve Limits","display":"Theorem — Right Adjoints Preserve Limits","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits","aliases":["14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits"],"display":"Theorem — Right Adjoints Preserve Limits","depends_on":["[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Right Adjoints Preserve Limits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\)</span> (adjunction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> (diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(G_0,G_1)\">\\(G=(G_0,G_1)\\)</span> (right adjoint components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\)</span> (limit-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 为小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\pi\">\\(L,\\pi\\)</span> 为候选锥数据。函子复合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(G_0(L),(G_1(\\pi_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},G\\circ D\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(G_0(L),(G_1(\\pi_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},G\\circ D\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries，印刷页 22；DjVu 第 17 图页。</p>\n<p>给锥 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to GD\">\\(X\\to GD\\)</span>，用伴随双射逐分量转为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FX\\to D\">\\(FX\\to D\\)</span>，经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的极限唯一提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FX\\to L\">\\(FX\\to L\\)</span>，再转回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to GL\">\\(X\\to GL\\)</span>。双射的自然性保证锥方程和唯一性，故所写像锥为极限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)$ (adjunction, see [[14-df-adjoint-functors]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)$ (diagram, see [[14-df-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob}$ (object-set operation, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsLimit}$ (limit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$；$J$ 为小范畴，$L,\\pi$ 为候选锥数据。函子复合见 [[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"G=(G_0,G_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsLimit}","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"L,\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(G_0(L),(G_1(\\pi_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},G\\circ D\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X\\to GD","display":false},{"tex":"FX\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"FX\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"X\\to GL","display":false}],"bytes":1549,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits|Theorem — Right Adjoints Preserve Limits]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits|Theorem — Right Adjoints Preserve Limits]]"},{"id":"8a95d86314c18fd6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"包含函子是层化的右伴随，直接应用 [[14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits]]。逐点极限的层条件也可验证：每个分量的唯一粘合与图中的态射相容，由极限的唯一性得到整体粘合。"}],"outgoing":["55bd5d1a324171ab","d2b4e5cf16585f95","dad26c5de724390a","1f1269584b34ad4b","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}